# Right-clicks are press-and-hold here (the DSL's click is the left button).
# Coordinates: IRICE-TEST 1920x1080, scale 1, the default Control Center layout
# (setup below resets it). Material grid: x0 1512, y0 50, columns 94 apart
# (86 wide), rows 80 apart (72 tall). Glass grid: x0 1560, y0 50, columns
# and rows 82.5 apart (72.5). Default layout rows: 0 Wi-Fi 2x1 + Now Playing
# 2x2; 1 Bluetooth, Night Light; 2 Focus 2x1, Stages, Dark Mode; 3 Display;
# 4 Sound; 5 Screenshot, Record, Caffeine, Clipboard; 6 Mirroring 2x1.
look material
setup python3 -I -c "import json,os;p=os.path.expanduser('~/.config/tessera/config.json');c=json.load(open(p));c.setdefault('controlCenter',{})['layout']=[];json.dump(c,open(p,'w'),indent=4)"
wait 2
setup sh -c 'while :; do pw-play --volume 0.05 /usr/share/sounds/freedesktop/stereo/complete.oga; done' >/dev/null 2>&1 &
wait 2
ipc panels open controlCenter IRICE-TEST
wait 1
ptr move 1854 406 sleep 100 click
wait 1
shot sound-page
note find the Applications row's slider and the Microphone slider in the shot (page inside the panel, x 1512..1880)
note drag each 10%->90% over 800 ms with ptr down/glide/up at the coordinates read from the shot; the fill follows to the end
setup pactl list sink-inputs short
key -k Escape
ipc panels close
wait 1
look glass
wait 3
ipc panels open controlCenter IRICE-TEST
wait 1
ptr move 1720 416 sleep 50 down sleep 1100 up
wait 1
shot glass-sound-page
note same drags on the Glass popover (x 1198..1518)
ipc panels close
ptr move 1700 15 sleep 100 click
wait 1
shot status-sound-menu
note status Sound menu (the bar's speaker icon — x from the shot): drag its volume slider 10%->90%; it follows to the end
